# Benchmark results
benchmarks/ripser/results/

# Corpus-derived tables. The licence of the grid-cell recordings -- and so
# of the distance matrices derived from them, and of every table computed
# from those matrices -- has not been settled. The repository had carried
# two of them: the characterisation (one row per recording, with the
# corpus' own file names) and the 582-cell benchmark.
#
# The matrices themselves were never in the repository, and the numbers the
# paper quotes are aggregates; but a table that names every recording of
# the corpus is not "the scripts and the characterisation", and until the
# licence question is answered the safe set is the smaller one. Both files
# live in the delivery directory with the rest of the tables.
benchmarks/ripser/characterize_gridcells.csv
benchmarks/ripser/gca_results_final.csv
benchmarks/ripser/gridcells_validation.csv
benchmarks/spatial/outputs/
*.json

